DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/challenges/widgets/{sitekey}
Destroy a Turnstile Widget.
Required: account_id (path); sitekey (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/challenges/widgets/{sitekey}
Show a single challenge widget configuration.
Required: account_id (path); sitekey (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/challenges/widgets/{sitekey}
Update the configuration of a widget.
Required: account_id (path); sitekey (path); body (body)
